{"version":1,"content":"<p>10月29日，《華爾街日報》周三發文稱，多年來，蘋果公司一直擁有強大的議價能力，對閃存晶片供應商予取予求，要求獲得行業最低價，甚至審計供應商的賬目。然而，AI需求改變了這一局面，供應商們「翻身」了，他們轉而對蘋果收取更高售價。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1584280.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T07:02:22.921385+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":118,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T06:40:56+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T06:58:55.750399+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T06:58:55.750399+00:00","content_hash":"24fdb7e7b94113fd564fa45e391bb029edd115b854af5af36ad711e7f8a14f80","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}